# Intelligence Hub first-read (mandatory)

For **Revu / estimating / MCP / suite-status** questions, **retrieve from the Intelligence Hub first**. Inspect repos only when the index points there.

This is a **mechanical gate**, not a preference. Violations (repo-wide grep, subagents, or full L: scan before compact slices) invalidate the answer.

## Trigger topics

Apply when the task may involve any of:

- Revu MCP, Bluebeam Revu, CapitalGlassRevu, plan markup, takeoff
- Computer Estimator, opening detection, `cg-opening-locator-v1`, parser evidence
- Suite MCP status, work packages, blockers, active ledger
- Bid Composer estimating intake, `revu-production-takeoff-pilot-v1`
- `revu-opening-detection-top10-v1`, `revu-mcp-production-workflow-locked`

**Three retrieval classes** (do not conflate):

| Class | Topics | First surface |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Domain / program / location / symbol** | Vision Plane, `admit_structure`, owner repo, program id | **Federated estate → owner local index** (`luna:retrieve --query`) |
| **Revu / estimating binary evidence** | Open the PDF, markup the plan, Studio URL, plan binary | **L: fail-closed** — `L_DRIVE_NOT_MOUNTED_IN_WSL`; no repo grep substitute |
| **Suite status / blockers / active work** | Work packages, blockers, open actions, host authority, ledger state | Hub compact slices (layered failover below) |

Decision ID: `CAD-20260803-retrieval-failover-layered` (`CapitalGlass-Cross-Agent/decisions/DECISION_LOG.md`).

